  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-turquoise-necklace-by-clem-nalwood', '4443935068', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4443935068/vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-turquoise?click_key=EuBx0mClPiSdZ1De4o4rPsxL_G69%3ALT23f258b611f520fb365123add02c5c118db0ea92&click_sum=f99217d8&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-69489-9-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver & Turquoise Necklace by Clem Nalwood', 'This great necklace from one of my favorite Navajo silver artists, Clem Nalwood. It''s from my personal collection, and has been treated with great care for many years. This is a perfect marriage of Tuequoise and well-executed silver applique details. Nalwood''s style depends on traditional silvercraft, but is unique and modern in the execution of traditional techniques. This necklace is a show-stopper from the massive carved and polished Turquouse stones to the complex floral medallions in graduated sizes that adorn the entire necklace. Two perfectly matched stones are set in simple bezels and surrounded by convex curves of silver, some of which are further decorated with elegant stamped patterns. Every detail is lovingly produced, including the chain, which flows naturally into the design of the center section through beautifully crafted bridges of silver. It''s 29 inches long, but the length can be adjusted by hooking a different link. Cherish this one!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
