  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-sterling-turquoise-native-american-drop-earrings-by-t-b', '1896813637', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1896813637/vintage-sterling-turquoise-native?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALT0f5d02ef7475a88b8daf4d844aff474214ca2a57&click_sum=97d6a794&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-37&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALT0f5d02ef7475a88b8daf4d844aff474214ca2a57',
   'Vintage Sterling Turquoise Native American Drop Earrings by T B', 'These vintage sterling silver drop earrings showcase a beautifully stamped Native American motif, highlighting traditional craftsmanship and intricate detailing. Their concave shape adds depth and dimension, creating a striking yet elegant look. At the base of each earring sits a raised turquoise cabochon, bringing a vibrant pop of color that perfectly complements the silverwork. Pictures best describe. Excellent condition, no damages. The backs are marked: "Sterling", "T B". Not too sure of the maker. Measurement is Approx.: 3 inches L by 5/8 inches W Total Weight is Approx.: 7 Grams I tested this piece with acid and it is guaranteed to be sterling silver. E-mail me with any questions you may have prior to purchase.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
