  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-earrings-sterling-wild-horse-magnesite', '1319118874', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1319118874/stunning-wild-horse-magnesite-and?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTf73d693b453813b9244d404a94e6d08384b06efb&click_sum=abd0ee91&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-36&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTf73d693b453813b9244d404a94e6d08384b06efb',
   'Navajo Earrings, Sterling & Wild Horse Magnesite', 'These Navajo dangle earrings feature truly beautiful brown and white stones. I like the way they echo nature; I spend time under the Redwood trees here in Northern California, and this color palette is very familiar from my walks. These remind me of leaves reflected in water -- the pattern is just stunning and the stones are perfectly matched. The stones are set in simple smooth bezels, framed in artfully hand-sawn silver mounts. The earrings are marked sterling and hallmarked by the maker. I acquired these from the stock of a retired shop owner, and they are in pristine condition.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
