   'De Chelly Shop Crescent Moon Black Onyx Earrings Sterling and Black Onyx Native American Hand Stamped Moon Earrings Long Crescent Moon', 'De Chelly Shop Crescent Moon Black Onyx Jet Sterling Native American Hand Stamped Earrings 2+" Long Crescent Moon Earrings The hand stamping on these is very fine and they have great patina...they were post, I revamped them into dangles with new sturdy sterling wires. (I have another set of De Chelly earrings/necklace listed also) They are very beautiful and go with everything. Onyx’s energy: protective, grounding and strengthening, also wonderful for boosting your willpower and discipline.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
