  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'ben-j-chavez-sterling-silver-black-onyx-stud-navajo-earrings', '1725649611', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1725649611/ben-j-chavez-sterling-silver-black-onyx?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTd9cb9661194a3f3b9e276a6774fb0c4eab4e37de&click_sum=a80cbb43&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-34&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTd9cb9661194a3f3b9e276a6774fb0c4eab4e37de',
   'Ben J Chavez Sterling Silver Black Onyx Stud Navajo Earrings', 'Ben J Chavez Sterling Silver Black Onyx Stud Navajo Earrings Measurements 0.90 in x 1.05 in Weight 10.5 grams Stamp Sterling Ben J Chavez Sterling Silver earrings backs are included. In good pre-owned condition with some surface wear, light scratches, patina and small imperfections. One of the posts seems to have been soldered back and there is a little soldering residue on the back. Photos show the item that is being sold. Please check photos for details before purchase because photos are part of the description. This item has NOT been polished, because most customers prefer the patina/vintage look, or prefer to polish it themselves. Items are gently washed with warm water and soap. Photos are close up to show details/ imperfections and thus the item may appear larger/smaller than it is. Refer to the description for measurements and photos of the item with ruler or other measuring tools for size reference. Items are pre-owned, unless stated otherwise, and have imperfections. Please keep this in mind when purchasing. Some items are in better condition than others. I try to describe the condition to the best of my ability, but there may be imperfections that are not worded but rather seen in photos. Please note that I take photos in bright lights and the color might be slightly different in person due to different screen resolutions and lighting. Don''t hesitate to contact me with any questions prior to purchasing. Items that are not stamped are tested for sterling silver. Free domestic shipping on orders over $35 Orders over $250 will be shipped with signature confirmation for domestic US destinations and USPS priority Mail International for international destinations. Please message me if you wish to change the shipping. U54 010225', 'turquoise-jewelry',
