   'Mohave Turquoise Cluster Earrings | Sterling Silver Dangles | Southwestern Jewelry 925 Sterling Silver Stud', 'Mohave Turquoise Cluster Earrings | Sterling Silver Dangles | Southwestern Jewelry 925 Sterling Silver Stud ♥️Gemstone Name :- Genuine Turquoise Gemstone ♥️Metal :- 925 Sterling Silver ♥️Sterling Silver vs. Silver Plated Jewelry♥️ *925 Sterling Silver: 925 Sterling Silver is a high-quality alloy containing 92.5% pure silver throughout the entire piece. *Silver Plated: Whereas silver-plated items consist of a base metal (such as copper or brass) covered with a layer of silver. ♥️♥️ ♥️♥️ Welcome to WesternJewelryMart ♥️♥️♥️♥️ A place of joy and inspiration for passionate jewellery designers and makers. At WesternJewelryMart, we offer beautiful, intricate, and uniquely designed jewellery-making supplies. Each piece is a true beauty to behold—crafted with care, set in silver and metal, and adorned with precious gemstones. Our collections blend fashion-forward trends with timeless design sensibilities, creating contemporary pieces that delight the senses and inspire creativity. It’s a match made in heaven—one that will leave you wanting more. As you captivate the world with your exquisite, trend-setting creations, we work diligently behind the scenes to bring you consistently gorgeous collections of jewellery supplies and accessories. Each piece is crafted to perfection, designed to elevate your style and add a touch of chic elegance to your jewellery. Ideal for creating occasional or standout pieces, every item in our collection helps turn your vision into something truly stunning. ♥️Key features: - Crafted from genuine Turquoise gemstones, each piece uniquely vibrant and natural - Made with 925 sterling silver for quality, longevity, and comfort - Handcrafted design with a distinctive half cluster stud style - Perfect for southwestern jewelry enthusiasts and collectors of authentic Turquoise jewelry. ♥️Care instructions: - Keep away from harsh chemicals and perfumes - Store in a soft pouch or jewelry box to prevent scratches - Clean gently with a soft cloth to maintain', 'turquoise-jewelry',
