  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-old-pawn-sterling-silver-cuff-bracelet-sonoran-gold-turquoise-han', '4614234860', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614234860/vintage-navajo-old-pawn-sterling-silver?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALT45b2675d0415a39f09fe9e805cc6f214173bd507&click_sum=675a61be&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-28&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALT45b2675d0415a39f09fe9e805cc6f214173bd507',
   'Vintage Navajo Old Pawn Sterling Silver Cuff Bracelet – Sonoran Gold Turquoise – Handmade One of a Kind – 90.9g Size~ 6 - 6.5', 'Bring the spirit of the Southwest to your collection with this Vintage Navajo Old Pawn Sterling Silver Cuff Bracelet, a one-of-a-kind handmade piece featuring a stunning Sonoran Gold Turquoise cabochon. Handcrafted by a skilled Navajo artisan, this classic cuff combines traditional silverwork with the soft, sky-blue beauty of high-grade turquoise. The smooth cabochon is securely set in a bezel and framed by hand-tooled sterling silver, showcasing craftsmanship rooted in Native American heritage. Item Details: Origin: Vintage Navajo Old Pawn (Handmade, unsigned) Material: Sterling Silver (tested) Stone: Natural Sonoran Gold Turquoise Weight: 90.9grams Style: Traditional Southwestern Cuff Bracelet Condition: Excellent vintage condition with natural patina This bracelet is a timeless expression of Navajo artistry, perfect as a standout statement piece or a meaningful gift for lovers of Native American jewelry and turquoise. ✨ Only one available – truly one of a kind. 📦 Ships carefully packaged with tracking and insurance. 💎 Add a rare and authentic touch to your jewelry collection today.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
