  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-buffalo-turquoise-handmade-gemstone-necklace-925-sterling-silver-pendant', '4415245514', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4415245514/navajo-buffalo-turquoise-handmade?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALT4a6ef5531effff142e00fa8dd40cfa50d216988e&click_sum=f9e0d433&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-27&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&pop=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALT4a6ef5531effff142e00fa8dd40cfa50d216988e',
   'Navajo Buffalo Turquoise Handmade Gemstone Necklace 925 Sterling Silver Pendant', 'Navajo Buffalo Turquoise Handmade Gemstone Necklace 925 Sterling Silver Pendant ******************************************************** Welcome to Poojajewelcrafts, your destination for handcrafted sterling silver and gemstone jewelry designed with love, detail, and passion. Each piece in our collection is a celebration of timeless beauty and artisan craftsmanship — where tradition meets modern elegance. Our jewelry is handmade in small batches using ethically sourced natural gemstones like moonstone, amethyst, larimar, green onyx, and sapphire — each chosen for its unique energy and color. Whether you’re drawn to boho-chic, vintage-inspired, or minimalist elegance, you’ll find something that resonates with your soul. ******************************************************** 💎 Shop Highlights: 1 Authentic 925 sterling silver jewelry 2 Handcrafted gemstone rings, earrings & bracelets 3 Meaningful jewelry gifts for birthdays, weddings & special occasions 4 Bohemian & vintage-inspired designs 5 Custom orders available upon request ✨ Each design carries a story — inspired by nature, handcrafted with care, and made to bring joy and confidence to the one who wears it. Thank you for supporting handmade craftsmanship. Explore our collection and find a piece that speaks to your heart. ********************************************************', 'turquoise-jewelry',
