  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-early-navajo-simple-sterling-silver-and-turquoise-squash-blossom-necklac', '4613356115', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4613356115/vintage-early-navajo-simple-sterling?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTa8cda51b697860b84e98daa5d7dd5018046f6853&click_sum=30831ad4&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-26&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTa8cda51b697860b84e98daa5d7dd5018046f6853',
   'Vintage early Navajo simple sterling silver and turquoise squash blossom necklace', '======================== Squash Blossom Details ======================== + Metal: Sterling silver - Unmarked, but tested positive + Gemstone(s): Genuine Turquoise + Signed: No + Weight: 50.8g + Length: 18” — An extender could be included for a small fee. In addition, necklace could be shortened for a small fee as well — please contact for details + Naja: 1 15/16” L x 1 15/16” W + Pomegranates: approx. 1 1/8 x 1/2” + Beads: approx. 7mm + Original handmade sterling bench beads or “pearls” + Strung on it’s original foxtail chain (could be restrung for an additional fee — contact for details) + Sterling Hook & Eye clasp + Please note, this is a delicate vintage piece. While it has been tested for strength and integrity, it possible there could be some breakage in the future over time, so please handle with care. We are always happy to help repair any damages that might occur after purchasing (WITHIN REASON). Just contact us for details! + Please contact if you have any questions about specific details regarding materials. + Please see ALL PHOTOS for quality and condition details. ***Please note: Due to the price, rarity and delicate nature of this piece, a signature may be required upon delivery if purchased. If you’d like to waive this stipulation, please specify in the notes section at checkout or send us a message*** ===================== General Information: ===================== + Please note that this is both a handmade and vintage item and while I do my best to hunt down the most pristine pieces, there may be some general wear and tear. I try my hardest to give you as much information as possible so please read all details and look at all photos. Please don’t hesitate to contact me with any questions you have about any of my handmade and vintage items! + All items are UNPOLISHED and are in original vintage condition - if you prefer your item to be polished with a polishing cl