  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-hopi-sterling-silver-multi-gemstone-brooch', '4542867156', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4542867156/vintage-hopi-sterling-silver-multi?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALT4910b75f0674bd2e0d44f1c50b717b458d8f64b8&click_sum=227e6e72&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-22&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALT4910b75f0674bd2e0d44f1c50b717b458d8f64b8',
   'Vintage Hopi Sterling Silver Multi-Gemstone Brooch', 'Details: This rare Lucian Koinva (Hopi) brooch is a unique piece of jewelry that showcases the artistry of Native American craftsmanship. Made of sterling silver and featuring seven striking stones including turquoise, coral, and lapis lazuli, this brooch is a true statement piece. The brooch is signed by the artist and is a vintage piece that was handmade in the United States. ✮ Material: Sterling Silver, Lapis Lazuli, Turquoise, Coral ✮Circa: 1990''s ✮Marks: LK, Sterling ✮ Condition: Previously owned and vintage condition', 'turquoise-jewelry',
