  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-naja-necklace-925-sterling-silver-g862', '4612022510', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4612022510/turquoise-naja-necklace-925-sterling?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALT0afd663e0540382acf588e14568eacacbf5074dc&click_sum=ae286e84&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-21&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALT0afd663e0540382acf588e14568eacacbf5074dc',
   'Turquoise Naja Necklace | 925 Sterling Silver | G862', 'Make a statement with this handcrafted turquoise Naja necklace, featuring nine genuine turquoise stones set in 925 sterling silver. The distinctive Naja design showcases an elegant arrangement of teardrop and oval turquoise stones in beautiful shades of blue and green, accented by natural earthy matrix patterns. Each stone is individually secured in a sterling silver setting with decorative rope-style borders and oxidized detailing that enhances the craftsmanship. The open-center Naja design creates a graceful, balanced silhouette, while the elongated silver link chain complements the bold Southwestern-inspired centerpiece. Handmade with care by our small business, Texas Gems and Jewelry, this necklace is a striking addition to any Western jewelry collection. Perfect for pairing with denim, dresses, or layered Southwestern outfits. Exported By ExportYourStore', 'turquoise-jewelry',
