  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-green-turquoise-ring-size-4-75-to-5-sterling-silver-split-shank-s', '4614187552', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614187552/vintage-navajo-green-turquoise-ring-size?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTedbfeddbc9914691a882afeb704e0c807dc1609b&click_sum=ccd3c0ed&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-20&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTedbfeddbc9914691a882afeb704e0c807dc1609b',
   'Vintage Navajo Green Turquoise Ring Size 4.75 to 5 / Sterling Silver Split Shank Sawtooth Bezel Southwest Silver Turquoise Jewelry Gift', 'By ordering you have confirmed that you’ve read the entire description carefully. Vintage Navajo-style turquoise ring. Handcrafted from pure sterling silver (professionally acid-tested) and featuring a rare, vibrant deep green turquoise cabochon, this piece highlights a rich natural matrix with earthy brown and deep charcoal veining. The oval stone is setting in a classic handmade sawtooth bezel, atop a split-shank band adorned with delicate, traditional hand-stamped detailing. Measurements - Turquoise stone size 16mmx 10mm - Sized 4.8 (ideal for sizes 4.75 to 5), this delicate yet statement-making piece is perfect as a pinky ring or for smaller hands, carrying the timeless, soulful character that only authentic, pre-owned estate jewelry can offer. By ordering you have confirmed that you’ve read the entire description carefully. Please note we sell mostly used & vintage items that come with a previous life. Some of these items are several decades old and may bear traces of time, such as minor discoloration, patina or wear. Be sure you read the full description & review all pictures before purchasing as they are By ordering you have confirmed that you’ve read the entire description part of the description. You are welcome to contact us before placing your order to clarify any details * Please don''t hesitate to message us if there''s a problem with your purchase', 'turquoise-jewelry',
