  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-sterling-silver-coral-taxco-cuff-bracelet-butterfly-mexico-southwestern-', '4614196760', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614196760/vintage-sterling-silver-coral-taxco-cuff?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTdf053eeb7f0a24361a6d4a76820cec222a453c6d&click_sum=d95e5161&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-19&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTdf053eeb7f0a24361a6d4a76820cec222a453c6d',
   'Vintage Sterling Silver Coral Taxco Cuff Bracelet | Butterfly Mexico Southwestern Jewelry | Western Stacking Bangle', 'Vintage sterling silver butterfly cuff bracelet featuring natural orange coral inlay. This delicate Taxco, Mexico piece has a minimalist design with a handcrafted butterfly centerpiece. It is marked 925 Mexico with an unidentified Taxco workshop hallmark. The exact maker has not been identified, but the hallmark style is consistent with vintage Taxco production. The butterfly measures approximately 3/8” tall, making it an understated everyday piece that layers beautifully with other bracelets. Measurements * Total wearable size: 6 7/8” (5 7/8” cuff with 1” gap) * Butterfly (face): 3/8” tall (approximately 10 mm) * Marked: 925 Mexico with unidentified workshop hallmark Please review all photos for condition and hallmark details. Taxco, Mexico, sterling silver, 925, coral, butterfly, cuff bracelet, bangle, artisan jewelry, handmade, vintage, minimalist, stackable, orange coral, Mexican silver', 'turquoise-jewelry',
