  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vernon-begaye-sterling-and-multi-stone-bolo-tie-dn-as-theshopsinuptown', '4613597036', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4613597036/vernon-begaye-sterling-and-multi-stone?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTbc972aa2fc5a3fb06b39556d13260ee0c7abdcfc&click_sum=5035f7cb&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-17&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTbc972aa2fc5a3fb06b39556d13260ee0c7abdcfc',
   'Vernon Begaye Sterling and Multi Stone Bolo Tie / DN AS / TheShopsInUptown', 'A very unique bolo tie made by award winning Navajo artist and sterling smith Vernon Begaye. The bolo tie pendant is sterling the multiple stones and it is strung on a brown braided leather string. The stones on the pendant include Royston turquoise, coral, white horse, agate, red carnelian, spotted agate, and a pearl. Vernon Begaye''s signature is on the back (see picture #3). The video and the second picture were taken in natural sunlight, and the rest were taken in studio lighting. A quarter was added to picture #9 for size reference. Measurements: String length: 20 3/4" Pendant length: 3 3/8" Pendant width: 1 1/2" Royston Turquoise: approx. 19mm x 15mm Coral: approx. 2mm x 12mm White Horse: approx. 12mm x 2mm Agate: approx. 9mm x 10mm Red Carnelian: approx. 5mm x 5mm Spotted agate: approx. 29mm x 21mm Pearl: approx. 5mm x 5mm Weight: 59 grams Condition: Excellent! This is brand new and has not been worn yet!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
