   'Handmade Leather Beaded Bracelets, Unisex Brazilian Western Design', 'How to Order Step 1: Choose Your Size S/M L/XL Step 2: Choose Your Design Design 1 Design 2 Design 3 Design 4 Design 5 Design 6 Design 7 Design 8 Design 9 Sizing Guide Each bracelet features 5 adjustment holes for a comfortable fit. S/M Size Measurements from buckle to holes: 5.9" 6.3" 6.7" 7.0" 7.5" L/XL Size Measurements from buckle to holes: 6.7" 7.0" 7.5" 7.9" 8.2" Add a unique touch of western, bohemian, and Native-inspired style to your collection with this stunning handmade beaded leather bracelet from Sambboho. Each bracelet is individually handcrafted by talented female artisans in Brazil using premium Slovakian glass beads and genuine full-grain leather. The vibrant beadwork and timeless geometric patterns make every piece a wearable work of art. Features ✓ Fully handmade by female artisans in Brazil ✓ Premium full-grain leather ✓ World-renowned Slovakian glass beads ✓ Organic beeswax-treated leather for enhanced water resistance ✓ Hypoallergenic stainless steel buckle closure ✓ Flexible, comfortable leather that molds naturally to your wrist ✓ Vibrant western, boho, and Native-inspired patterns ✓ Fair Trade certified production ✓ Matches our coordinating dog collars, belts, hatbands, and accessories ✓ Fast shipping from the USA Fair Trade & Artisan Made Our bracelets are handcrafted by women artisans in the community of Araxá, Minas Gerais, Brazil. Every purchase helps create sustainable income opportunities and allows these talented artists to achieve financial independence through their craft. When you purchase a Sambboho bracelet, you''re not only supporting handmade artistry but also helping preserve traditional beadwork techniques and empowering women through fair trade employment. Materials Full-grain genuine leather Premium Slovakian glass beads Stainless steel buckle Organic beeswax leather treatment Shipping 📦 Ships from San Diego, California Orders ship within 2 business days Average delivery time: 3 business days within the United States Tracki', 'turquoise-jewelry',
